2 CONT Orda Ichen (Lord Orda, Орд эзэн ("Ord ezen")) was a Mongol Khan and military strategist who ruled eastern part of the Golden Horde (division of the Mongol Empire) during the 13th century.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT the eldest son, had a bet on the banks of the Irtysh. 1 Great Khan of the White Horde. From the government refused. Gave the supreme reign of his brother Batu. Founded the White Horde Khanate (as ulus Golden Horde) in 1227. Sygnak
2 CONC  made ​​his capital. Shared his possessions with his brother Shibani. Horde is probably the only one among Genghis voluntarily conceded superiority to another. The founder of the Khans beloordynskih
