1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT Монгольская династия, правившая в Монголии в 1271-1368 (Юани), Золотой Орде с 1227, Белой Орде с 1227, государстве Хулагуидов, Мавераннагре и др. Завоевали в XIII почти всю Азию. В Европе дошли до стен Вены и Триеста. Создали вели
2 CONC чайшую империю в истории человечества. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Toqoqan / Togha Temür / Togoi Khan, was a member of the ruling family of Mongol Empire. He was a son of Batu Khan.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Last Chingizid ruler
2 CONT
2 CONT Ilkhan after Abu Saeed.
2 CONT
2 CONT Togha Temür (died late 1353), also known as Taghaytimur, was a claimant to the throne of the Ilkhanate in the mid-14th century. Of the many individuals who attempted to become Ilkhan after the death of Abu Sa'id, Togha Temür was t
2 CONC he only one who hailed from eastern Iran, and was the last major candidate who was of the house of Genghis Khan. His base of power was Gurgan and western Khurasan. His name "Togoy Tomor" means "Bowl/Pot Iron" in the Mongolian lang
2 CONC uage.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://bit.ly/1OpxvYD
2 CONT
2 CONT ...[Toqha Temur who could trace his ancestry back over 6 generations to Jochi Qasar, a brother of Chingiz Khan...]
