1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 3 Great Khan of the White Horde
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT For many years Khuyndjy Khan was the ruler of Orda ulus and very good friend of Arghun Khan. later he was in very good friendship with Ghazan Khan - King of Islam. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Khuyndjy Khan was very fat and heavy. He was growing bigger with every day. If came to the point that guards had to watch him day and night so he would not lay flat in his sleep as he could suffocate from his fat. There was no hor
2 CONC se to hold him. He was transported in the carriage dragged by horses. At the end he fell asleep and fat covered his throat and he died of suffocation.
2 CONT
2 CONT Khuyndzy had four elder wives and several concubines. 
2 CONT
2 CONT From source:  Collection chronicles Rashid al-Din, Volumes 2-3, page 67
