2 CONC egen was also put to death in Iraq on 2 April 1297. His 12-year-old son Toghai was spared due to the efforts of Bulughan Khatun Khurasani, Ghazan's wife Arghun Aqa's granddaughter and given to the household of Amir Husayn. Others 
2 CONC spared were his brother Yol Qutluq and his nephew Kuchluk.]
