2 CONC 1253) THEODORA Doukaina Komnene Palaiologina Batatzaina, daughter of IOANNES Batatzes & his wife Evdokia Angelina ([1240]-4 Mar 1303). ... Emperor Mikhael VIII & his wife had seven children:
