2 CONC "[27].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' ([1216]) as his first wife, ANDRONIKOS Doukas Komnenos Palaiologos, son of ALEXIOS Palaiologos & his wife --- ([1190]-Thessaloniki [1248/52]). 
2 CONT
