1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Theodore_Svetoslav_of_Bulgaria
2 CONT
2 CONT * Reign	1300–1322
2 CONT * Born	1270s
2 CONT * Died	1322
2 CONT * Predecessor	Chaka
2 CONT * Successor	George Terter II
2 CONT * Consort	Euphrosyne
2 CONT * Theodora Palaiologina
