2 CONT                       # D1. Vsevolod III, Pr of Belz, +after 1245
2 CONT                             * E1. [parentage uncertain] Gremislava, *bef 1284, +13.9.1302; m.ca 1280 Pr Boleslaw I of Opole (+14.5.1313)
2 CONT                       # D2. Anastasia; 1m: 1245/47 Pr Boleslaw I of Masovia (+25.2.1248); 2m: after 1248 Dymitr, a Hungarian boyar
2 CONT                 + C2. Vsevolod, Pr of Cherven (1207-1212), Pr of Belz (1211-15), +after 1215
