2 CONT
2 CONT http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/RUSSIA,%20Rurik.htm#VasilkovnaMMstislavRomanovichdied1223
2 CONT
2 CONT ___________________________________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT Vasilkovna.  m MSTISLAV Romanovich "Dobriy/the Good" Prince of Pskov, son of ROMAN Rostislavich Grand Prince of Kiev & his wife MARIA Sviatoslavna of Chernigov (-killed in battle Kalka River 30 May 1223).  Prince of Smolensk 1197-
2 CONC 1213.  He succeeded in 1214 as MSTISLAV Grand Prince of Kiev.   See below
2 CONT
2 CONT ____________________________________________________________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT SVIATOSLAV Vseslavich, son of VSESLAV Briacheslavich "the Werewolf" Prince of Polotsk & his wife ---.  Prince of Polotsk.  1140.  m ---.  The name of Sviatoslav´s wife is not known.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sviatoslav & his wife had one child:  1.         VASILKO Sviatoslavich (-[1143]).  Prince of Polotsk 1132.  m ---.  The name of Vasilko´s wife is not known.  Vasilko & his wife had six children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT a)         VSEVOLOD Vasilkovich. 
2 CONT
2 CONT b)         VSESLAV Vasilkovich (-[1186]).  Prince of Vitebsk.  Prince of Polotsk 1162.  m --- Romanovna, daughter of ROMAN Rostislavich Grand Prince of Kiev Prince of Smolensk Prince of Novgorod & his wife Maria Sviatoslavna of Ch
2 CONC ernigov.  Vseslav & his wife had one child: 
2 CONT
2 CONT i)          --- Vseslavna.  m (3 Feb 1174) IAROPOLK Rostislavich Prince of Torzok, son of ROSTISLAV Iurievich Prince of Pereyaslavl & his wife --- of Riazan (-after 1196).  Prince of Chernigov 1174, Prince of Novgorod and Vladimir
2 CONC  1175.  No issue. 
2 CONT
2 CONT c)         BRIACHESLAV Vasilkovich.  Prince of Iziaslav 1158-1159.  Prince of Vitebsk 1159-1181.  m ---.  The name of Briacheslav´s wife is not known.  Briacheslav & his wife had one child: 
2 CONT
2 CONT i)          VASILKO II Bryacheslavich (-after 1216).  Prince of Vitebsk 1192.  m --- Davidovna, daughter of DAVID Rostislavich Prince of Novgorod and Smolensk & his wife ---. 
2 CONT
2 CONT (a)       BRYACHESLAV II Vasilkovich.  Prince of Polotsk and Vitebsk.  m ---. 
2 CONT
2 CONT (1)       PARASKEVIYA [Aleksandra] Bryacheslavna (-[1261/62]).  m (Smolensk 1239) as his first wife, ALEKSANDR Iaroslavich Prince of Novgorod, Dmitrov and Pereyaslavl, son of IAROSLAV Vsevolodich Grand Prince of Vladimir & his thi
2 CONC rd wife Fedosia Igorevich of Riazan ([30 May 1220]-Gorodetzk 14 Nov 1263, bur Vladimir).  He succeeded his brother in 1252 as ALEKSANDR "Nievskiy" Grand Prince of Vladimir. 
2 CONT
2 CONT (b)       --- Vasilkovna.  m MSTISLAV Romanovich "Dobriy/the Good" Prince of Pskov, son of ROMAN Rostislavich Grand Prince of Kiev & his wife MARIA Sviatoslavna of Chernigov (-killed in battle Kalka River 30 May 1223).  Prince of 
2 CONC Smolensk 1197-1213.  He succeeded in 1214 as MSTISLAV Grand Prince of Kiev. 
2 CONT
2 CONT (c)       LIUBOV Vasilkovna.  m (1209) as his second wife, VSEVOLOD Iurievich "Balshoe Gniezdo/Big Nest" Prince of Vladimir and Riazan, son of IURII Vladimirovich "Dolgorukiy/Longarm" Grand Prince of Kiev & his second wife Helena 
2 CONC Komnene (1154-14/15 Apr 1212). 
2 CONT
2 CONT d)         IZIASLAV Vasilkovich (-before 1185).  Prince of Gorodno. 
2 CONT
2 CONT e)         VOLODAR Vasilkovich.  1159
2 CONT
2 CONT f)          MARIA Vasilkovna .  m (1143) as his first wife, SVIATOSLAV Vsevolodich of Kiev, son of VSEVOLOD II Olegovich Grand Prince of Kiev & his wife Maria Mstislavna of Kiev (-24 Jul 1194).  He was installed as Prince of Volyn
2 CONC ia [1144], Prince of Chernigov 1164-1176.  He succeeded in 1176 as SVIATOSLAV III Grand Prince of Kiev. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources: __________________________
2 CONT
