2 CONT his sons :
2 CONT
2 CONT - Uzbek Khan (1282–1341), Khan of the Golden Horde 1312–1342
2 CONT   his sons   1  .Timur († 1328)
2 CONT                   2  .Tini Beg , Khan of the Golden Horde 1342
2 CONT                   3  .Dschani Beg († 1357), Khan of the Golden Horde 1342-1357
2 CONT                   4. Chidur Beg
2 CONT
2 CONT Dschani Beg's sons :
2 CONT                   1.Berdi Beg , Khan of the Golden Horde 1357–1359
