2 CONT * Moncada, Francisco de, Catalan Chronicle.
2 CONT * Ernest Marcos Hierro, Almogàvers: la història, L'esfera dels llibres, Barcelona 2005.
2 CONT
2 CONT Retrieved from "http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roger_de_Flor"
2 CONT
2 CONT Categories: 1266 births | 1306 deaths | Byzantine mercenaries | Mercenaries | History of Catalonia
2 CONT
2 CONT The song "Catalan Vengeance", also known as "My six gold rings are dearly bought", deals very loosely with the outline of de Flor's career and, especially, subsequent events culminating in the battle of Kephissos River. Words here
2 CONC : http://www.calonsong.org/CalontirSongs/catalanvengeance.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: there is some back-influence from Gordon R. Dickson's "Ballad of Jacques Chretien" (a science-fiction filksong) - de Flor was assassinated, not hanged.
2 CONT
