2 CONT b)       '''  IOANNES Komnenos Doukas Angelos Petraliphas Raoul''' (-[1273/74]).  Georgios Akropolites names "Ioannem Raulum, primum protovestiarii Raulis filium" as one of the supporters of Emperor Mikhael VIII[616].  Pachymeres 
2 CONC records that "Ioannem…Raulem, protovestiarii Raulis filium" was created "protovestiarium" by Emperor Mikhael VIII (in [1261/62])[617].  He served the emperor in his campaigns to reincorporate Epirus and Thessaly into the empire[61
2 CONC 8].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' ([1261/62]) as her second husband, THEODORA Palaiologina Komnene Kantakouzene, widow of GEORGIOS Mouzalon, daughter of IOANNES Komnenos Angelos Kantakouzenos & his wife Eirene Komnene Palaiologina ([1240]-6 Dec 1300).  Pac
2 CONC hymeres records that "Ioannem…Raulem, protovestiarii Raulis filium" married "vidua protovestiarii Muzalonis…Theodora, neptis…imperatoris Palaeologi, eius sororis Eulogiæ ex Cantacuzeno filia" (in [1261/62])[619].  She became a nun
2 CONC  as KYRIAKE.  
