2 CONT **F1. Helene Dukaina Tornikina Komnene; m.ca 1288 '''Alexios Raul (+1303)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------- 
2 CONT
2 CONT The MedLands states, his father was IOANNES Komnenos Doukas Angelos Petraliphas Raoul (-[1273/74]). His mother was THEODORA Palaiologina Komnene Kantakouzene, widow of GEORGIOS Mouzalon, daughter of IOANNES Komnenos Angelos Kantak
2 CONC ouzenos & his wife Eirene Komnene Palaiologina ([1240]-6 Dec 1300). He had two wifes and one child.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/BYZANTINE%20NOBILITY.htm#AlexiosRauldied1303
2 CONT
2 CONT '''ALEXIOS Raoul (-1303).  Megas Stratopedarchos.  Megas domestikos'''.  m firstly --- Tarchaneiotissa, daughter of MIKHAEL Tarchaneiotes & his wife ---.  Pachymeres names "Tarchaniotæ gener Alexius Raul"[622].  m secondly --- [An
2 CONC gelina], daughter of [MIKHAEL Komnenos Angelos "Kutrules" Despot & his [first] wife [Anna Komnene Palaiologina].  Alexios Raoul's wife is recorded as the daughter of "Despot Mikhael Angelos".  It appears more likely from a chronol
2 CONC ogical point of view that she was the daughter of Mikhael "Kutrules", although she would presumably have been very young at the time of the marriage.  It is improbable that she was the daughter of Mikhael [II] Lord of Epirus, whos
2 CONC e children would have been born in the range [1235/45].  Alexios & his [first/second] wife had [one possible child]:  (a)       --- Raoul (-1345 or after).  The primary source which confirms his parentage has not yet been identifi
2 CONC ed.  Megas stratopedarchos.  1294-1345.  m HELENA, daughter of IOANNES Doukas Angelos & his wife ---.  The primary source which confirms her parentage and marriage has not yet been identified.  He & his wife had one child:  (1)   
2 CONC     EIRENE .  The primary source which confirms her parentage has not yet been identified. 
