1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ivaylo_of_Bulgaria
2 CONT
2 CONT ------
2 CONT
2 CONT -http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/BULGARIA.htm#Ivajlodied1280
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.         IVAJLO, son of --- (-murdered 1280).  A pig farmer, he led local resistance to Tatar raids in the mid-1270s.  As his reputation grew, the territory from which he gathered support widened[382].  He proclaimed himself IVA
2 CONC JLO Tsar of the Bulgarians, and in 1277 defeated the troops sent by Konstantin Tih to repress his rebellion, Tsar Konstantin being killed in the battle.  Ivajlo besieged Trnovo, and in late Spring 1278 Tsarica Maria opened the gat
2 CONC es of the city to him, recognised him as Tsar and married him as her third husband[383].  His followers became alienated by his assimilation into the establishment[384].  He left Trnovo to combat the Tatars in late 1278, the city 
2 CONC opening its gates in Feb 1279 to Byzantine forces and Ivan Asen III who was recognised as Tsar.  Ivajlo's wife was sent to Emperor Michael VIII, who imprisoned her in Adrianople[385].  Pursued by the Byzantine forces of Tsar Ivan 
2 CONC Asen III, Ivajlo occupied the fortress of Silistria but succeeded in defeating Ivan Asen III in Jun and Aug 1279.  He was murdered by Tatar supporters of Nogaj[386].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' (1278) as her third husband, MARIA Palaiologina Kantakouzene, widow firstly of ALEXIOS Philes and secondly of KONSTANTIN Tih Tsar of the Bulgarians, daughter of IOANNES Kantakouzenos & his wife Eirene Palaiologina (-after 
2 CONC 1279).  She continued to rule in Trnovo after her second husband was killed in battle, but after Ivajlo besieged Trnovo she opened the city gates to him in late spring 1278 and married him as her second husband[387].  After Trnovo
2 CONC  opened its gates to Byzantine troops in Feb 1279, she was sent to Emperor Mikhael VIII who imprisoned her in Adrianople[388].  
2 CONT
2 CONT   Tsar Ivajlo & his wife had one child: 
2 CONT
2 CONT *a)         daughter ([1279/80]-).  The primary source which confirms her parentage has not been identified. 
