2 CONC s reconstituting his father's holdings. He made his brother Vasylko ruler of Volhynia and retained the Galician title for himself, though he continued to exercise real powers in both places. Territorial boundaries of the Kingdom o
2 CONC f Galicia–Volhynia (1245-1349).
