2 CONT Bolesław III Wrymouth
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Between March and July of 1115, Boleslaw married secondly with Salome (b. bef. 1101 - d. 27 July 1144), daughter of Henry, Count of Berg-Schelklingen. They had thirteen children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes (b. 1137 - d. aft. 1182), married in 1151 to Mstislav II Kyjevský, Prince of Vladimir and Volynia and Grand Prince of Kiev since 1168.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mstislav II of Kiev
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1151 Mstislav married Agnieszka, the daughter of Duke Boleslaus III of Poland. They had three sons:
2 CONT
2 CONT Roman Mstislavich (c. 1152-1205)
2 CONT
2 CONT Sviatoslav Mstislavich, Prince of Brest
2 CONT
2 CONT Vsevolod Mstislavich of Volhynia, Prince of Belz, Prince of Volodymyr-Volynsky (died 1196)
