1 NOTE Kaliman II, son of Kaliman I, punished his father's murder by killing his cousin Michael Asen, who had been responsible for the death of Kaliman I.  Kaliman II succeeded Michael to the throne of the 2nd Kingdom of Bularia in 1257.
2 CONC   Kaliman II was also killed just a year later in 1258.
