2 CONT '''Roman Rostislavich''' (Russian: Роман Ростиславич) (died 1180), Prince of Smolensk (1160–1172, 1177–1180), Grand Prince of Kiev (1171–1173, 1175–1177) and Prince of Novgorod (1178–1179). He was the son of Rostislav Mstislavich.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A0%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%B0%D0%BD_%D0%A0%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B8%D1%81%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%87
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Roman I. Kiev - Kiev Grand Duke (Prince of Kiev & Smolensk) Роман Игоревич Киев - Киев великий князь (киевский князь и Смоленске)
2 CONT
2 CONT * http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kievan_Rus%27#mediaviewer/File:Kingdom_of_Galicia_Volhynia_Rus%27_Ukraine_1245_1349.jpg
2 CONT
