1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Andrey Vladimirovich "Dolgaya Ruka" (Long Arm) is a Russian prince, ruler of Vyazma, the ancestor of the princes Vyazemsky - the first Prince of Viazma. In other words: the first Viazemsky. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Killed in 1224 during the Battle of Kalka against the Tatars, the first major battle against the Tatars--a bloody Russian defeat. 
