2 CONT [Sarai-mulk khanym was the daughter of Chingizid - Kazan Khan , the last legitimate ruler of the Chagatai ulus from the Chingizid dynasty . Modern experts believe that the real name of Amir Temur's eldest wife sounded like Saray M
2 CONC alik khanum. [one]
