2 CONT -http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/BYZANTIUM%2012611453.htm#AlexiosDPdiedafter1143B
2 CONT
2 CONT '''ALEXIOS Doukas Palaiologos''', son of GEORGIOS Palaiologos & his wife Anna Doukaina ([1095/1100]-after 1143).  The primary source which confirms his parentage has not been identified.  He was banished before 1143.  General of E
2 CONC mperor Manuel II in 1143. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' --- Komnene, daughter of [ALEXIOS Komnenos & his wife ---] ([1100/05]-).  The primary source which confirms her parentage and marriage has not been identified.  
2 CONT
2 CONT    Alexios Palaiologos & his wife had [three] children:
2 CONT *1.         GEORGIOS Komnenodoukas Palaiologos ([1125]-[1167/68]).  ... ... ...  m ---.  The name of Georgios's wife is not known.  Georgios & his wife had three or more children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT *2.         KONSTANTINOS Palaiologos (-after 1166).  The primary source which confirms his parentage has not been identified. 
2 CONT
2 CONT -------
2 CONT
2 CONT   Family  ( https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/George_Palaiologos )
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/people/George-Palaiologos/6000000007297857008 George] had a younger brother, Nicholas. Through his marriage to Anna Doukaina, he had four sons:[4]
2 CONT
2 CONT *Nikephoros, one of the ancestors of the Palaiologos family that became the Empire's ruling dynasty after 1261. He had issue:
2 CONT **Michael
2 CONT ***Alexios, megas doux. Married to Irene Komnene.
2 CONT ****Andronikos Palaiologos, megas domestikos
2 CONT *Andronikos, doux of Thessalonica. Married to Komnene, granddaughter of Constantine X Doukas.
2 CONT *Michael, a sebastos
2 CONT *'''Alexios''', married Anna Komnene Doukaina and he is the other ancestor of the imperial house of Palaiologos. He had issue:
2 CONT **George Palaiologos, megas hetaireiarches
2 CONT ***Alexios despot. Married to Irene Angelina (daughter of [https://www.geni.com/people/Alexios-III-byzantine-emperor/6000000000515214098 Alexios III Angelos]). 
2 CONT ****Theodora Palaiologina, married to Andronikos Palaiologos, megas domestikos
2 CONT
