2 CONT ** ...
2 CONT **B2. S'''tefan Prvovencani "the First-Crowned", Duke of all Serbia (1196-1217), crowned by papal legate as King of Raska (Serbia) (1217-27), +as the monk Simon 1227''';1m: 1191 (repudiated 1201/02) Eudoxia Angelina; 2m: 1204/07 N
