2 CONT '''Theodora is believed to have been born sometime around 1180/5 in Constantinople to parents whose identities are uncertain. However, it is known that one of her grandmothers was a daughter of a Byzantine Emperor[2]. As such, The
2 CONC odora may have been a daughter of John Doukas (son of Andronikos Angelos)[3] or else a daughter of one of Andronikos Angelos' daughters'''[1].
