2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rostislav_I_of_Kiev
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Reigned for the most part in Smolensk. In 1154, then from 4/12/1159 to 1167, he was Grand Prince of Kiev. "Truly pious" - according to Karamzin
