2 CONT *****E1. Vsevolod, Pr of Novgorod (1221-23), *23.10.1212, +perished during the massacre of Vladimir 7.2.1237; m.14.4.1230 Marina of Kiev (+perished 7.2.1238)
2 CONT *****E2. Mstislav, *1218, +k.a.Vladimir 7.2.1238; m.1236 Maria N (+7.2.1238)
