1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Kir-Mikhail Mikhailovich (Kur Mikhail; died 1277) - Specific Prince of Pronsky, from Rurik XII geeration, son of Mikhail Vsevolodovich, prince of Pronsk and Vera (Alyona) - daughter of the Grand Duke of Chernigov V
2 CONC sevolod Chermny.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Ipatiev Chronicle mentions Kyur (Kir) Mikhailovich, who brought the news of the Mongol invasion to Vladimir in 1237 (and died during the invasion). According to the BDT version, the son of Mikhail was called Vsevolod.
