2 CONT Translation (Google)
2 CONT
2 CONT Konrad II of Znojmo (died 1161) - from the Czech Premyslid, Duke of 1123-1128 and 1134-1161 Znojmo, Moravia, Duke of 1160th Son of Luitpold (Lupolda) Prince Znojmo (d. 1112) and Ida from Babenbergów, grandson of the Duke of Bohemi
2 CONC a Conrad I. His wife was Maria Serbian (d. after 1189), daughter of the Serbian prince Urosza I was her sister, Elena (Helena), wife Hungarian king Bela II.
2 CONT
2 CONT  children:
2 CONT
2 CONT  #Ernest (died 1156),
2 CONT  #Konrad Otto II, Duke of Bohemia,
2 CONT  #Znojmo Helena, wife Kazimerza the Righteous
