2 CONT    2. ^ [1]
2 CONT    3. ^ POLAND, Medieval Lands
2 CONT
2 CONT Preceded by Konrad II of Masovia 	Duke of Masovia 1294-1313 	Succeeded by Siemowit II and Trojden I
