1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Uliana/ Yuliyana/ Juliana. Princess of Tver, "Juliana Rurikides". (Russian: Ульяна Александровна Тверская)
2 CONT
2 CONT * Born c.a. 1325 Pskov, Russia.
2 CONT * Died c.a 1392.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Father: Grand Prince Alexander of Tver
2 CONT * Mother: Anastasia of Halych
2 CONT * Spouse: The second 2 wife of Olgierd / Algirdas, Prince of Lithuania, Marriage c.a. 1346.
2 CONT * Issue: Uliana and Algirdas had thirteen children: six sons and seven daughters.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----------------
2 CONT ALGIRDAS [Olgierd], s/o GEDIMINAS Grand Duke of Lithuania & Olga Vsevolodovna of Smolensk]  ([1296]-end May 1377).  Baptised ALEKSANDER.  
2 CONT x  (1318) [MARIA] Iaroslavna of Vitebsk, d/o IAROSLAV Vasilievich Prince of Vitebsk (-1346). 
2 CONT >1.         ANDREI ([1319]-killed in battle 12 Aug 1399) baptised ANDREI Prince of Pskov. Prince of Polotsk. 
2 CONT >2.         KONSTANTIN (-[1386/30 Oct 1393]).  Prince of Czartorysk.   
2 CONT >3.         OLEŁKO WŁODZIMIERZ (-1398).  Prince of Kiev
2 CONT >4.         FEODOR (-before 1400).  Prince of Ratno [Ratnie].   
2 CONT >5.       KORIBUTAS [Korybut] ([1331]->1404).  Prince of Novgorod Severskiy baptised DMITRY 
2 CONT >6.         FEODORA x  (>1376) SVIATOSLAV Titovich Prince of Karachev, s/o  TIT Mstislavich Prince of Karachev
2 CONT >7.         daughter x IVAN Iurievich Prince of Novosilsk and Odoievsk s/o IURII Romanovich Prince of Novosilsk (->1371).
2 CONT >8.         MARIA [Agrafena] (-1393) x (1354) BORIS Konstantinovich Prince of Gorodeno, s/o KONSTANTIN Vasilievich Grand Prince of Suzdal and Nizhni-Novgorod & Ielena --- (<1340-12 May 1394).  Grand Prince of Suzdal and Nizhni-Nov
2 CONC gorod. 
2 CONT
2 CONT xx ([1350]) IULIANA Aleksandrovna of Tver, d/o ALEXANDER I Mikhailovich Prince of Tver, ex-Grand Prince of Vladimir & Anastasia [Iurievna of Galich] ([1325]-1392). 
2 CONT >9.         KENNA ([1350]-27 Apr 1368) baptised as JOHANNA x (1360) KASIMIR von Pommern, s/o BOGISLAW V Duke of Pomerania in Hinterpommern Elźbieta of Poland ([1351]-2 Jan 1377).
2 CONT >10.      JOGAILA [Jagiello] ([1351]-1 Jun 1434). Grand Prince of Lithuania 1382/3-1386 and 1392/1401.  He succeeded as WŁADISŁAW II King of Poland 1386-1434
2 CONT >11.      SKIRGAILA [Skirgajllo] (-11 Jan 1397).  Prince of Kiev 1395.  Prince of Lithuania 1386-1392.
2 CONT >12.      LENGVENIS [Lingweni] ([1355]-after 19 Jun 1431).  Prince of Mstislavsk.  baptised SZYMON in 1386. x (14 Jun 1394) MARIA Dmitrievna of Moscow, d/o DMITRY Ivanovich "Donskoy" Grand Prince of Vladimir, Prince of Moscow & Ie
2 CONC vdokia Dmitrievna of Suzdal (-1399) xx (winter [1406/07]) NN, from Moscow. 
2 CONT >13.      KORIGAILA [Korigajllo] (-killed in battle Vilna 28 Oct 1392) baptised KAZIMIERZ in 1386.
2 CONT >14.      WIGAND [Wigunt] (-28 Jun 1392).  Prince of Kirnovo.  baptised ALEKSANDER x (< 25 Jan 1390) HEDWIG von Oppeln, d/o WLADISLAW Duke of Oppeln, Palatine of Hungary [Piast] & Euphemia of Mazovia [Piast] ([1376/78]->13 May 139
2 CONC 0).
2 CONT >15.      ŠVITRIGAILA [Svidrigailo] (-10 Feb 1452).  baptised BOLESŁAW.  Prince of Polock 1400/02.  After 1406, Prince of Vladimir-Volhynsk Perejeslavl Volokolamsk.  Prince of Chermigov 1419/30.  He succeeded in 1430 as ŠVITRIGAIL
2 CONC A Grand Duke of Lithuania, until 1432.  x  ([1430/33]) ANNA Ivanovna of Tver, d/o IVAN Ivanovich Prince of Tver (-[1471/28 Sep 1484]). adopted the name SOFIA 
2 CONT >16.      ELENA (-15 Sep 1438).  She became a nun as IEPRAKSIA x  (Winter [1371/72]) VLADIMIR Andreievich “Khrobry/the Brave” Prince of Sierpukhov and Bobrovsk, s/o ANDREI Ivanovich of Moscow, Prince of Sierpukhov and Bobrovsk & M
2 CONC aria Konstantinovna of Rostov-Borisoglebsk (15 Jul 1353-4 or 14 May 1410).
2 CONT >17.      MARIA x (1379) VAIDILA [Wojdylo] Starost of Lidzki (-1382) xx DAVID Dmitrievich Prince of Gorodeno [Gorodetsk].
2 CONT >18.      WILHEIDA KATARZYNA (-> 4 Apr 1422) x (1388) JOHANN von Mecklenburg-Stargard, s/o JOHANN I Herzog von Mecklenburg-Stargard & Agnes von Lindau-Ruppin (-[6 Jul/9 Oct] 1416, bur Sternberg).  
2 CONT >19.      ALEKSANDRA (-19 Jun 1434) x  ([1387]) SIEMOWIT IV Prince of Plock and Kujavia, s/o SIEMOWIT III "Starszy" Prince of Mazovia & Euphemia von Troppau [Přemyslid] (before 1352-5 Dec 1425).
2 CONT >20.      JADWIGA (-> 13 May 1400) x (1394) HANUŠ III Duke of Auschwitz [Oświęcim], s/o HANUŠ II Duke of Auschwitz [Piast] & Hedwig von Brieg [Piast] ([1366/76]-1405, > 19 Aug). 
2 CONT https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/LITHUANIA.htm#Algirdasdied1377B
