2 CONT
2 CONT ''Paleologa princess'', daughter of the Byzantine emperor John V and his wife Helena Kantakouzene. 
2 CONT She married Yakub in 1386, while two of her sisters married Yakub's father Murad I and his half-brother Bayezid I.
