2 CONT  Semkowicz et al. 1913 ↓, p. 181.
2 CONT  Olejnik et al. 1993 ↓, p. 167.
2 CONT  Prochaska et al. 1882 ↓, p. 73.
2 CONT  Semkowicz et al. 1913 ↓, p. 182.
