2 CONT
2 CONT Janike (Crimean: Canike, جانـيـكه ; late 14th century - 1437)- Crimean princess of the Genghis Khan, daughter of the Golden Horde Khan Tokhtamish, wife of the Emir Edigei - the founder of the Nogai Horde, ruler of Kirk -Oru.
