2 CONC …figliolo del figliolo dell´imperatore Ioannre Cantacusino*" in Peloponnesos 1431/36, in Trebizond 1436/37. He lived at the court of his brother-in-law Djuradj Branković of Serbia 1437. Serbian Archon at Semendria 1454/56
