2 CONC a we went by land to Kerasunt followed almost servilely by the emir Chatzymyris and some Turks"[315].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' firstly ---.  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' secondly (after 29 Aug 1358) THEODORA Komnene, illegitimate daughter of BASILEIOS Emperor in Trebizond & his second (bigamous) wife Eirene ---.  The Chronicle of Michael Panaretos records that "the daughter of the emperor 
2 CONC lord Basil, the Lady Theodora" left 29 Aug 1358 to be married to "the emir Chatzymyris, Bayram´s son" with "lord Basil Choupakas Scholaris as the bridal escort"[316].  
2 CONT
2 CONT Omar & his [first] wife had one child:  
