2 CONC en. The primary source about their order of births is the chronicle of Niketas Choniates: Alexios Komnenos (February, 1106 - 1142), co-emperor from 1122 to 1142. His birth is recorded in the Alexiad  by Anna Komnene. Maria Komnene
2 CONC  (twin to Alexios), who married John Roger Dalassenos.  Andronikos Komnenos  (died 1142).  Anna Komnene, married Stephanos Kontostephanos.  Isaac Komnenos  (died 1154).  Theodora Komnene (d. 12 May 1157 ), who married Manuel Anema
