2 CONT      Agnes Babenberg was born in 1154. ▼1 She was the daughter of Heinrich II Jasomirgott Herzog von Österreich and Theodora Comnene. ▼1 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Stephen III Arpád, King of Hungary, son of Geisa II Arpád, King of Hungary and Euphrosine of Novgorod, in 1167. ▼1 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Hermann, Duke of Croatia. ▼1 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1182. ▼1
