2 CONT '''John Kantakouzenos''' (Greek: Ἰωάννης Καντακουζηνός; fl. 1183–86) was a military commander and an early member of the Kantakouzenos family. The contemporary historian Niketas Choniates describes him as a brave, audacious and ex
2 CONC perienced soldier but frequently led astray by his foolhardiness and presumption.[1] .. ...
