2 CONT The first Albanian feudal state was declared at Krujë (Kroja) by the Archon Progon in [1190].  Progon’s older son, Gjin Progonović was Lord of Krujë and Elbasan from [1200] to [1208].  The independent state of Albania founded by P
2 CONC rogon lasted until the middle of the 13th century, after which the country relapsed into disunity.  The primary sources which confirm the parentage and marriages of the members of this family have not yet been identified, unless o
2 CONC therwise stated below.  
