2 CONT ***i)          daughter (-before 1216).  m as his first wife, GRGUR Kamonas, son of ---.  Sébastos.  Lord of Krujë.  Archon of Krujë and Elbasan.
2 CONT **b)         DIMITRIJE Progonović (-1215).  Lord of Krujë by 1208[3].  His territory was conquered in [1214/15] by Mikhael Komnenos Doukas Lord of Epirus[4].  m as her first husband, KOMINIA of Serbia, daughter of STEFAN Grand Žup
