1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elena-Evgenia,_wife_of_Ivan_Asen_I
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Elena''' (Bulgarian: Елена) was the second wife of tsar Ivan Asen I of Bulgaria. She was the mother of tsar Ivan Asen II of Bulgaria.
2 CONT
2 CONT   Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Her antecedents are unknown. She is sometimes alleged to be a daughter of [https://www.geni.com/people/Stefan-Nemanja-Grand-zoupanos/5114070051290082444 Stefan Nemanja of Serbia], but this relationship is questionable and would ha
2 CONC ve caused various canonical impediments to marriages between their descendants. Elena married Ivan Asen I in 1183 at the age of thirteen.
2 CONT
2 CONT By her marriage to Ivan Asen I, Elena had at least two sons:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Ivan Asen II, emperor of Bulgaria 1218–1241
2 CONT # Alexander (Aleksandăr), sebastokrator, who died after 1232; Alexander had a son named Kaliman Asen II, emperor of Bulgaria in 1256
2 CONT
2 CONT After the assassination of Ivan Asen I in 1196, Elena retired to a convent under the monastic name '''Evgenia'''[1] (Bulgarian: Евгения). Her memory is honored in the Synodic of Bulgarian Church: <br/>
2 CONT ''For Elena, the new and pious tsarina, mother of the great tsar Ivan Asen, adopted then an angelic image and called Evgenia, may her memory live forever.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT -------
2 CONT ---------
2 CONT
2 CONT Ivan Asen I of Bulgaria
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT  Family
2 CONT
2 CONT Ivan Asen I was married first to a certain Maria, buried at Červen, and then to Elena (religious name Evgenija), whose antecedents are unknown. She is sometimes alleged to be a daughter of Stefan Nemanja of Serbia, but this relati
2 CONC onship is questionable and would have caused various canonical impediments to marriages between their descendants. By his marriage to Elena, Ivan Asen I had at least two sons:
2 CONT
2 CONT Ivan Asen II, emperor of Bulgaria 1218-1241
2 CONT
2 CONT Alexander (Aleksandăr), sebastokratōr, who died after 1232; Alexander had a son named Kaliman Asen II, emperor of Bulgaria in 1256
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
