1 NOTE {geni:about_me} VSEVOLODNA OF GORODENO 
2 CONT
2 CONT Vsevolodna of Gorodeno (modern day Hrodna, Belarus) was the daughter of Vsevolodko Davidovich / Prince of Gorodenko and his wife, Agafia Vladimirovna.  In 1144, Vsevolodna married, as her first husband, Vladimir Davidovitch / Prin
2 CONC ce of Chernigov.  Known issue of this marriage was Sviatoslav Vladimirovitch / Prince of Vshchizh (d. 1166 / 1167)............In 1152, Vsevolodna married, as her second husband, Baszkord / Khan of the Cumans.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source -- Medieval Lands:  Russia, Rurikid
