1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Svyatoslav_III_Igorevich Wikipedia_EN]
2 CONT * [http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/RUSSIA,%20Rurik.htm#SviatoslavIgorevichdied1211 Medlands]
