2 CONT Last Edited=9 Jul 2008
2 CONT
2 CONT      Rixa von Berg was the daughter of Heinrich Graf von Berg. (1) She married Vladislav I, Duke of Bohemia, son of Vratislav I, King of Bohemia. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1125. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Rixa von Berg and Vladislav I, Duke of Bohemia
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Vladislav I, King of Bohemia+ d. 1174 (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT -2. Depolt I of Bohemia+ d. 1167 (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT -3. Heinrich of Bohemia+ d. a 1169 (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT Forrás:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p11393.htm#i113922
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Richenza of Berg (c. 1095 – 27 September 1125) was the wife of Vladislav I of Bohemia and the Duchess of Bohemia. She was the daughter of count Henry I of Berg and his wife Adelheid of Mochental.
2 CONT
2 CONT Richenza married Vladislav before 1111, her sister Sophie of Berg married another Přemyslid, Otto II the Black, in 1114. The third sister Salomea of Berg married Duke of Poland Bolesław III Wrymouth in 1115.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1125 dying Vladislav I confirmed his relative Otto II the Black as his succesor, which was also the wish of Vladislav wife Richenza. Only the intervention of his mother Świętosława changed his opinion. Not to like, Vladislav re
2 CONC conciled with his brother Soběslav.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT After Vladislav death (1125) disappointed Richenza wanted to move to Zwiefalten monastery, but died on the way on 27 September 1125. She is buried in Reichenbach.
2 CONT
2 CONT Issue
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Svatava
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Vladislav II of Bohemia (c.1110 - January 18, 1174), King of Bohemia
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Děpolt (- August 1167)
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Jindřich
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Vladislaus I of Bohemia
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Family
2 CONT
2 CONT By his wife Richeza of Berg (- September 27, 1125), daughter of Count Henry I of Berg, Vladislav I had four children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Svatava
2 CONT
2 CONT Vladislav II of Bohemia (c.1110 - January 18, 1174), King of Bohemia
2 CONT
2 CONT Děpolt (- August 1167)
2 CONT
2 CONT Jindřich
2 CONT
