2 CONC ealogy.EU.[self-published source][better source needed] Jump up ^ Genealogical database by Herbert Stoyan Jump up ^ Courtly Lives - Polish Royalty Jump up ^ Jasiński K., Rodowód pierwszych Piastów, Warsaw-Kraków 1992, pp. 235-240.
2 CONC  Jump up ^ Cawley, Charles, POLAND: Mieszko III died 1202, Foundation for Medieval Genealogy, retrieved August 2012,[better source needed]
2 CONT
