2 CONT    5. ^ According to some authors, she was daughter of Yaroslav Osmomysl's son Vladimir(ko); S. Łaguna, Rodowód Piastów, "Kwartalnik Historyczny", vol. XI, 1897, pp. 762-763; W. Dworzaczek, Genealogia, Warsaw 1959, tabl. 31.
2 CONT
2 CONT    6. ^ Parentage is disputed among sources and historians.
