1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Oleg Sviatoslavich, Mikhail==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Großfürst Sviatoslav II Iaroslavich, Rurikovich and Cecilia von Dithmarschen
2 CONT * Birth:	1058 in Чернигов, Черниговское Княжество  
2 CONT * Death:	August 01, 1115 (56-57) in Киев, Киевское Княжество
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Project MedLands Russia==
2 CONT
