1 NOTE The House of Vojislav was a medieval dynasty that inherited the claims over Duklja of the old ruling House of Saint Vladimir and the Serbian House of Vlastimir dynasty. It ruled Duklja and the surrounding territories; including Za
2 CONC humlje, Rascia and Bosnia, where the dynasty's side branches have become rulers. 
2 CONT It lasted from 1034 until 1186, when it was transformed into the House of Nemanja.
