1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The founder of the Gasparpechy family was the grandson of the king's butler Margit Dóczy de Nagyluche. Her mother was Ilona Arthandy, dcera Frusziny Thelegdy. Father Frusziny was a Duke of Seven (erdelyi vajda) and
2 CONC  Poharnik Istvan Thelegdy de Thelegd. He was a descendant of the famous Tsarnaev who was married to Arpad (the Arpads were 300 years of Hungarian kralmi). This is the first link to the royal families and means that every descendan
2 CONC t of the family Péchy (even indirect) is a descendant of the Arpads - all except the founder of the Gaspara family.
2 CONT
2 CONT By another line from Margit Dóczy to the Dob, the Liskays get to Anne Bathory (daughter of Istyn Bathory and Anna Medgyessy) through zen linie. Anna Medgyessy was the daughter of the Duke of Transylead the Medgyessy Pok and Erszéb
2 CONC eth Daroi (it's possible that it was up to her old family- that's not Russian). Even more pre-equidae were out of the world's pedigree on the Geni side,written as her father Miklos Medgyessy- bathrobe. But apparently it was her br
2 CONC other. And Erzsébeth Daroi was the daughter of Palatine Daroi Moys (his father was also a palatine, but with another king) and Erzsébeth Arpad Hazi the daughter of the Prince of Nitra and The Shaver and Andras and Rurik Helena. In
2 CONC  some pedigrees and Wikipedia, Erszébeth Arpád Házi appears as the daughter of Adras's brother, King Bela IV because he also had a daughter, Erszébeth. And navyse Andras died too young (but after seven years of marriage).
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Prepojenie Pechyovcov s kralovskymi rodmi
2 CONT
2 CONT Zakladatel rodu GasparPechy mal za manzelku vnucku kralovskeho komornika Margit Dóczy de Nagyluche. Jej matka bola Ilona Arthandy,dcera Frusziny Thelegdy.OtecFrusziny bol sedmohradsky vojvoda (erdelyi vajda ) a poharnik Istvan The
2 CONC legdy de Thelegd. Bol potomkom známeho Csanada,ktorý bol ženatý s Arpadovou (Arpadovci boli 300 rokov kralmi Uhorska). To je prve prepojenie na královske rody a znamená že každý potomok rodu Péchy (aj nepriamy) je potomkom Arpadov
2 CONC cov. Všetci okrem zakladatela rodu Gaspara.
2 CONT
2 CONT Inou líniou od Margit Dóczy cez Dobovcov, Liskayovcov dostaneme k Anne Bathory (dcére Istvána Bathoryho a Anny Medgyessy)- cez zenske linie. Anna Medgyessy bola dcerou sedmohradskeho vojvodu Medgyessyho Poka a Erszébeth Daroi. (je
2 CONC  mozne ze to boli až jej starí rodicia- to vsak nenarusa liniu). Ešte prednedavnom bol vcelosvetovom rodokmeni na stranke Geni. com,napísaný ako jej otec Miklos Medgyessy- župan. . Ale zrejme to bol jej brat. No a Erzsébeth daroi 
2 CONC bola dcéra palatina(jeho otec bol tiez palatin, ale pri inom kráľovi) Daroia Moysa a Erzsébeth Arpad hazi- dcéra kniežata nitrianskeho a Holíča Andrasa a Rurikovej Heleny. V niektorych rodokmenoch a vo Wikipedii sa Erszébeth Arpád
2 CONC házi vyskytuje ako dcera brataAndrasa- kráľa Bela. IV. ,pretože mal tiež dcéru Erszébeth. A navyse Andraszomrel priliš mladý(lenže po sedem ročnom manželstve)
2 CONT
2 CONT esküdött 1351
2 CONT
2 CONT emlitve 1355,1357-65
2 CONT
2 CONT Meghalt 1378 előtt
2 CONT
2 CONT The family divided into two major branches, which descended from the sons and grandsons of Briccius:
2 CONT
2 CONT The elder branch of the family, the Báthory of Somlyó were descended from John, Count of Szatmár, the first-born son of Briccius, through his eldest son Ladislaus (died 1373). Ladislaus, Count of Szabolcs, married Anna Meggyesi an
2 CONC d received Somlyó as dowry.[5] 
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://csaladaink.hu/Sztranyay%200.web/per00244.htm#0
2 CONT
2 CONT -----------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://genealogy.euweb.cz/hung/meggyesi.html
2 CONT ==Meggyesi (Móriczhidy) family==
2 CONT
2 CONT Móricz from Pok family, Asztalnokmester (magister dapiferorum), fl 1219-35 
2 CONT * A1. Móricz, Tárnokmester (magister tavernicorum), fl 1241-69; m.N Rátót, dau.of Domokos from Rátót (Rathold) family 
2 CONT ** B1. Miklós Meggyesi, Erdélyi vajda (Vajda of Transylvania) (1315-16), Pohárnokmester (magister pincernarum), Bereg, Szolnok, Máramaros Ugocsa vármegyék főispánja, fl 1270, +after 1319; 1m: Erzsébet Dárói, dau.of Moys Dárói by P
2 CONC ss Erzsébet of Halics; 2m: Erzsébet Nagymihályi, dau.of András Nagymihályi, from Kaplyon family 
2 CONT *** C1. [1m.] Móricz, Győr vármegye főispánja, fl 1319-40; m.N (Atyinai?) 
2 CONT **** D1. Simon, Horvát-Dalmát bán (Ban of Croatia and Dalmatia) (1369-1371), Győr, Sáros, Szepes, Pozsony, Varasd, Kraszna, Máramaros vármegyék főispánja, fl 1326-74, +before 20.10.1375; m.Katalin Lackfi (fl 1359-79) 
2 CONT ***** E1. János, fl 1375-1425, +before 1430; m.Gfn Johanna Fraknói (fl 1378), dau.of Gf Miklós Fraknói (Nagymartoni) 
2 CONT ****** F1. Miklós, fl 1401-25 
2 CONT ****** F2. Simon, +before 13.1.1433; m.Margit Dombai (fl 1433), dau.of György Dombai and Margit Töttös de Bátmonostor 
2 CONT ******* G1. Móricz, fl 1424-1441 
2 CONT ******** H1. László Móroc de Medgyesalja, fl 1445-90, +before 24.9.1490; m.Zsófia Kompolti de Nána (fl 1490) 
2 CONT ******** H2. István Móroc de Medgyesalja, fl 1445-92, +before 1.1.1493; m.Margit Kenderes (fl 1490-1504), dau.of János Kenderes
2 CONT ******* G2. István, fl 1429
2 CONT ***** E2. István, fl 1375-99
2 CONT **** D2. '''Anna, fl 1351-55'''; m.László Báthori de Somlyó, Ispán of Szabolcs (+before 1378)
2 CONT *** C2. István, Máramaros vármegye főispánja, fl 1319-27 
2 CONT **** D1. István, fl 1326-44
2 CONT *** C3. Miklós, fl 1319-26
2 CONT
