1 CONT Wives
1 CONT
1 CONT Anna of Novgorod (+ bef. 1252), 1218, daughter of Mstislav the Bold 
1 CONT NN, niece of King Mindaugas of Lithuania, bef. 1252 
1 CONT Brother
