1 CONC viv(Lwów, Lemberg) 
1 CONT Roman Danylovich (*ca 1230, +ca 1261), Prince of Black Ruthenia (Navahradak) 1255? - 1260?, and Slonim 
1 CONT Mstislav Danylovich (+aft 1300), Prince of Lutsk 1265 - 1289, Prince of Volynia 1289 - aft 1300 
