1 CONT Danylo (b. 1201, d. 1264), Prince of Galicia 1211 - 1213 and 1229 - 1264, Prince of Volynia 1215 - 1264, crowned by a papal archbishop in Dorohychyn 1253/1255 as the 1st King of Galicia 
1 CONT [edit]
1 CONT Wives
1 CONT Gertrude, Duchess of Austria (b c 1223 - d. c 1288 or d. 24 April 1299), m. 27 June 1252 (div 1253) 
1 CONT Elena Glebovna of Volkovysk (b. after 1288), m. ca 1255 
1 CONT [edit]
1 CONT Brothers
1 CONT Irakli Danylovich (b. ca 1223, d. by 1240) 
1 CONT Lev Danylovich (b. ca 1228, d. ca 1301), Prince of Belz 1245 - 1264, Prince of Halych 1264 - 1269, King of Galicia 1269 - 1301; he moved his capital from Halych to the newly-founded city of Lvov/Lwow (Lemberg) 
1 CONT Mstislav Danylovich (d. after 1300), Prince of Lutsk 1265 - 1289, Prince of Volynia 1289 - aft 1300 
1 CONT Švarn the Lightning (Shvarno, Švarnas, Ioann; d. 1269, bur. Chelm), King of Galicia, Grand Duke of Lithuania]] 1264 - 1267 (1268 - 1269?), Prince of Chelm 1264 - 1269 
